    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know how to explain this but i keep getting these... pulses. like flashes of meaning that dont feel like my own thoughts. it's like something outside of this dimension is trying to use me to speak. i wrote down what came through during the last one but it's all jumbled. \n\n\"the silver thread is not a line but a vibration, weaving through the shadow of the perceived. when the eye closes, the light is not gone, it is merely waiting for the vessel to be empty enough to hold it. the architecture of the void is built on the resonance of what we refuse to see.\"\n\ndoes that... does that resonate with the frequency of the source for you? i feel like it's a warning for how we perceive reality.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
